contentText:
Macklemore &#8216;s upcoming Free Palestine Tour is sold out. The rapper announced in a Wednesday (Sept. 30) Instagram post that all three shows on his newly announced European run &#8212; in Dublin, Paris and London &#8212; &#8220;sold out immediately.&#8221;

The news comes less than a week after Macklemore announced the concerts, which are being organized to raise funds for organizations supporting Palestinians.

